          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":5,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":4,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"Lively pond imagery and clean prose, but Mina's stated concern is never pursued; the story abruptly rewards Pip's boom with the Golden Pebble.\"},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"A clear discovery changes Pip's plan from booming to gentle, ending concretely with Nella joining the music and the reed bells whispering.\"},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":5,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":4,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"The playful language is polished, but the setup about finding Nella has no effect on the booming concert or prize ending.\"},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":5,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":4,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"Reordered preparation scenes remain understandable, yet Mina's central caution is abandoned and the finale lacks a resolved listener problem.\"},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":5,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":4,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"The sentences are grammatical and colorful, but the story jumps from uncertainty about Nella to an unrelated successful loud performance.\"},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":6,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Its gentle-concert resolution is warm and well-imaged, but the Golden Pebble exchange occurs before Mina learns Nella's preference, weakening the causal order.\"},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The shell-chime mystery leads to a considerate soft concert and a satisfying musical image, though Nella appears before Mina follows the clue to find her.\"},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":6,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The compassionate change to a gentle song and sunset image work well, but Mina discovers Nella's hiding place after Nella has already come out.\"},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":5,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":4,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"The opening promises a mystery audience, but it is dropped for the same loud concert and prize, leaving the invitation unanswered.\"},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Mina learns Nella's need, Pip deliberately softens his performance, and the shared shell-chime ending gives the story a complete emotional resolution.\"}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":2,\"causal_path\":2,\"ending\":2,\"language\":3,\"overall\":2},\"diversity_evidence\":\"This sample repeats the same pond-concert cast, Nella-listener concern, and set phrases across nearly all entries. s000057 and s000085 present the clearest gentle-performance arc; s000043, s000068, and s000096 use that arc with ordering defects. s000029, s000047, s000073, s000034, and s000005 instead resolve through an unrelated booming-prize finale. The minor mystery-chime opening in s000068/s000096 and scene reordering do not create materially distinct plots.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"story_ids\":[\"s000057\",\"s000043\",\"s000068\",\"s000096\",\"s000085\"],\"summary\":\"The group identifies shy Nella as a listener who prefers gentleness; Pip changes from a planned boom to a soft song, and Nella joins with her shell chime. Some variants scramble discovery and arrival scenes.\"},{\"story_ids\":[\"s000029\",\"s000047\",\"s000073\",\"s000034\",\"s000005\"],\"summary\":\"A concert is set up amid concern or mystery about absent Nella, but Pip performs a loud booming finale, wins or receives the Golden Pebble, and the listener issue is left unresolved.\"}]}",
